// EXAMPLE — copy this file to `Binario1Secrets.local.xcconfig` (same folder) and
// paste your local DEBUG backend token. `Binario1Secrets.local.xcconfig` is
// gitignored — NEVER commit a real token. The token is lightweight abuse-reduction
// only (a token shipped in an app can be extracted), not real security.
//
// It must match the Supabase `BINARIO_BOARD_APP_TOKEN` secret. Used for DEBUG only.
BINARIO_BOARD_APP_TOKEN = paste-local-token-here
